    "description": {
      "content": "This API provides information on Beazley's people and divisions. Please use the <a href=\"/docs/services/54e21d5297fe1e0f2475cf33/operations/54e21d5297fe1e08786b4f2d\">sandbox version</a> of this API  for initial development and testing. The current version of this is V1.<br><br>\r\n\r\nPlease contact <a href=\"mailto:ITArchitecture@Beazley.com?Subject=AboutBeazleyAPI\">\r\nITArchitecture@Beazley.com</a> if you have any questions about this API.",
